    "description": "A containerised import moved end to end without a platform sitting between the parties: shipper, pre-shipment inspection, freight forwarder, reefer ocean carrier, customs agent, and destination drayage. Each is bonded for more than its own leg is worth, so each has every reason to perform. The importer of record settles the entire chain with a single signature.",
    "name": "Containerised import chain",
    "summary": "Six bonded parties move a reefer container from shipper to consignee."
